# PATCH CONTEXT
# Why:
# - Gradle 9.4.1 exposes Kotlin 2.3 metadata, which Kotlin 2.1 cannot read.
#   RN 0.87 owns Kotlin 2.2.0, so Expo's included plugin must use the same
#   compatible compiler instead of suppressing metadata validation.
# - Expo 3.0.24 fills a dependency-local codegen path for pure-C++ modules.
#   RN 0.87 owns their generated spec in the app build and requires a null path,
#   matching both RN CLI 20.2 and Expo's maintained resolver.
# Remove when: Expo autolinking includes both fixes.

